# route review artifacts — process records, never deliverables.
# `.behavior/**/review/self/.gitignore` and `.behavior/**/.reviews/peer/.gitignore`
# already declare this convention; the ROOT `review/` exists only because
# `--as promised` reads `<repo-root>/review/self/` rather than the `.behavior/`
# path it prints, so the same files land at a second, unignored path.
review
